sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Operator/Admin
    participant CLI as kubectl-rhaii_validate<br/>(Controller)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NS as Namespace<br/>rhaii-validation
    participant Job as Per-Node Job Pod<br/>(run subcommand)
    participant GPU as GPU Hardware<br/>(Node)
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>rhaii-validate-report

    Note over Admin,CM: Phase 1 - Setup (Ephemeral Resources)
    Admin->>CLI: kubectl rhaii_validate [check-mode]
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Namespace (rhaii-validation)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Namespace created
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount (rhaii-validator)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRole (rhaii-validator)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBinding

    Note over CLI,K8sAPI: OpenShift Only
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create SCC ClusterRoleBinding<br/>(system:openshift:scc:privileged)

    Note over Admin,CM: Phase 2 - Platform Detection
    CLI->>K8sAPI: List Nodes (detect platform)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: OCP / EKS / AKS / CoreWeave
    CLI->>CLI: Load platform-specific config<br/>(GPU vendor, resources)

    Note over Admin,CM: Phase 3 - Check Execution
    loop For each GPU node
        CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Job<br/>env: GPU_VENDOR, CHECK_MODE, NODE_NAME
        K8sAPI->>Job: Schedule on target node
        Job->>GPU: Execute validation check<br/>(GPU/TCP/RDMA)
        GPU-->>Job: Check results
        Job->>K8sAPI: Write results to ConfigMap
        K8sAPI->>CM: Store report data
        Job-->>K8sAPI: Job completed
    end

    Note over Admin,CM: Phase 4 - Multi-Node Tests (if applicable)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create server Job (iperf3/RDMA)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create client Job(s)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Read report ConfigMap<br/>(cross-node coordination)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Aggregated results

    Note over Admin,CM: Phase 5 - Results & Cleanup
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Read pod logs (per-node results)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Validation results
    CLI->>Admin: Display validation report
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Delete Namespace (cascade)<br/>(deferred cleanup)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Delete ClusterRole
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Delete ClusterRoleBinding(s)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Cleanup complete
